      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wanakena%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wanakena hosts the SUNY-ESF Ranger School, a nationally recognized program for forest conservation and wilderness management.",
